# RT-qPCR 检测样板（AsterML v2）

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-rtqpcr-v2
schema: 1
title: RT-qPCR 相对定量实验
objective: 比较处理组与对照组靶基因相对表达量（2^-ddCt）
experimental_unit: well
primary_endpoint: Ct
endpoint_method: SYBR Green qPCR
endpoint_unit: "1"
```

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-rtqpcr
schema: 1
title: qPCR 实验分组
rows:
  - id: group-control
    name: 对照组
    role: control
    condition: untreated
```

```asterlab
kind: material
id: mat-sybr
schema: 1
name: SYBR Green
role: treatment
condition: qPCR master mix
concentration:
  value: 2
  unit: mg/mL
source: built_in
```

```asterlab
kind: sample
id: sample-cdna
schema: 1
sample_id: cDNA-01
group_ref: group-control
material_refs: [mat-sybr]
amount:
  value: 1
  unit: uL
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-qpcr
schema: 1
title: SYBR qPCR
endpoint: Ct
unit: "1"
group_refs: [group-control]
timepoints: [40_cycles]
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-qpcr-96
schema: 1
format: 96
topology: plate
assay: assay-qpcr
groups:
  group-control: [A1, A2, A3]
samples:
  A1: cDNA-01
roles:
  A1: sample
```

```asterlab
kind: data_table
id: dt-ct
schema: 1
title: Ct 扩增阈值记录表
schema_id: qpcr_ct
endpoint: Ct
columns:
  - key: well
    label: 孔位
    value_kind: text
  - key: ct
    label: Ct
    value_kind: number
    unit: 1
    min: 10
    max: 38
```
